      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brunswick%2C_Maine",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "While her husband taught at Bowdoin, Harriet Beecher Stowe penned Uncle Tom’s Cabin in Brunswick.",
